Package: zplexpress
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0), cups, cups-client
Maintainer: Louis Nyirongo <louisnyirongo@lukeinternational.no>
Homepage: https://github.com/malawi-ministry-of-health-dhd/zplexpress
Description: ZPL printing service with web dashboard
 A Node.js service that receives ZPL (Zebra Programming Language) over HTTP
 and prints to a CUPS printer. Includes a web dashboard for viewing service
 status, monitoring print jobs, and selecting the active printer.
